{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00827","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 禋顺 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 禋顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旨酒既献，嘉殽乃迎。\n振其鼗鼓，洁以鉶羹。\n肇禋肇祀，或炮或烹。\n皇尸俨若，保飨是明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}